//! from an int8 ONNX model quantized by ONNX Runtime. Do not edit; regenerate
//! from the model instead.
//! The importer's example resnet with int4 weights in every dense and convolution layer:
//! Conv 3x3 + ReLU -> MaxPool 2x2 -> a residual block (depthwise Conv 3x3 + ReLU
//! -> pointwise Conv, added to the Tanh of the block's input) -> Sigmoid -> AvgPool 2x2
//! -> global average pool -> Linear on a 2 x 8 x 24 input
//! (tools/import_onnx/models/resnet.onnx: QDQ format, per-channel weights).
//!
//! Integer-only and `no_std`: int8 input in the `INPUT` grid, int8 output in the
//! `OUTPUT` grid (real value = `SCALE * (q - ZERO_POINT)`). Feature maps are NHWC
//! without the batch axis, `[row][column][channel]`: the transpose of the NCHW
//! tensor the ONNX model takes.

